# App mode carries no document corpus on disk — upstream's per-task image serves the
# documents to the agent, and the verifier reads them from the `drbench` package it
# installs — so the only uncommitted files are the ones byte-identical across every task.
# They are single-sourced in harbor_adapters/drbench/templates/ and laid down by
# `python -m harbor_adapters.drbench.main --populate <dir>`.
#
# Only tests/case.json (this task's id and the upstream commit it is scored against) is
# committed per task.
*/environment/main.Dockerfile
*/environment/extract_text.py
*/tests/test.sh
*/tests/judge.py
# The verifier runs in its own environment, built from tests/ after the agent is done.
*/tests/Dockerfile
*/tests/docker-compose.yaml
*/tests/.dockerignore
